@ 12.1.1 - Proto-Abazgi to Ashkharywa Abaza
# citation: Nortaneous, from Chirikba, Viacheslav A. (2003), “Abkhaz”. Languages of the World/Materials 119.
	{ t͡ʃʷʼ, t͡ɕʼ, d͡ʒʷ, d͡ʑ } > { fʼ, t͡sʼ, v, d͡z }
	{ ɕ, ʑ } > { s, z }
	”Vʕ ʕ”V > ”aa a”a (but stays /ʕ/ sometimes?)
	ʕʷ > ɥ
	{ tʷʼ, dʷ } > { {tʷʼ,pʼ}, {dʷ,b} }